        "thinking": "I'm identifying \"अवप्साथाम्\" as luṅ madhyama dvivacana kartari of वप् (ātmanepada), working out the full paradigm: अवप्स्त, अवप्साताम्, अवप्सत; अवप्स्थाः, अवप्साथाम्, अवप्ध्वम्; अवप्सि... confirming वप् fits this form.\n\nFor āśīrliṅ ātmanepada madhyama dvivacana, I'm checking whether samprasāraṇa applies to वप् (a yajādi dhātu) — since वप् has अ rather than इक् before the halant, rule 1.2.11 doesn't make liṅ kit here, and सीयुट् in ātmanepada isn't ṅit either, so no samprasāraṇa occurs. This gives the standard forms वप्सीष्ट, वप्सीयास्ताम्, वप्सीरन्, वप्सीष्ठाः, वप्सीयास्थाम्, वप्सीढ्वम् — so the answer is वप्सीयास्थाम्.\n\n",
